WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.040
- You've done well acting in comedies.

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.140
So, like "The Office," I
know that happened as well,

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.490
so how did you end up doing "The Office?"

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.532
How did that

00:00:06.532 --> 00:00:07.410
audition-
- Well, "The Office,"

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.030
I've been doing normal auditions,

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.410
I found out how you really get a job,

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.780
and that is, you have tape of you

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.799
and one of the cast members on something.

00:00:14.799 --> 00:00:15.632
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:15.632 --> 00:00:16.465
- Like blackmail?

00:00:16.465 --> 00:00:17.298
- You for it, a little bit like blackmail.

00:00:17.298 --> 00:00:18.131
(all laughing)
(audience clapping)

00:00:18.131 --> 00:00:18.964
(Kelly clapping)
Rainn Wilson and I,

00:00:18.964 --> 00:00:19.797
about seven or eight years
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:19.797 --> 00:00:20.640
before that, (chuckling)

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.340
did a pilot called "The Expendables,"

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.490
where we played androids
that solved crimes.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:27.900
And we were like
(Kelly's voice drowns)

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.610
robotic but very human.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.550
We spent I think a good 30% of it naked

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:33.570
and charging like this.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.471
- Again what?

00:00:34.471 --> 00:00:35.413
(guest laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:00:35.413 --> 00:00:36.246
(guest clapping)

00:00:36.246 --> 00:00:37.079
- Just shooting above that.

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:39.900
And so, when I got there,
I did the whole audition,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.017
and one of the producers said,

00:00:41.017 --> 00:00:42.900
"So, I understand you're
friends with Rainn?"

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.090
And I said, "Yeah! Did
he tell you how we met?"

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:46.170
And he goes, "No,"

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.073
and I go, (chuckling) "I bet he didn't."

00:00:48.073 --> 00:00:49.110
(all laughing)

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:52.020
So, I told them, and they
were losing their minds

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.660
to try to picture Rainn
bein', and he was amazing,

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.030
and it's so funny, but we were like,

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.380
I am starting to have feelings,

00:00:58.380 --> 00:00:59.337
kind of thing like that.
- [Guest] Oh my. (laughs)

00:00:59.337 --> 00:01:00.960
- And I said, "So, I have that,

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.960
but not only that, if I get
this job, day one, I show up

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.630
with a DVD of that pilot
that I will give to you."

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.556
And I was not even in my
car, and my phone rang,

00:01:09.556 --> 00:01:10.410
(chuckling) and I was like, "Hello?

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:11.790
Oh, I got the job, so."

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:12.623
That's how I got on

00:01:12.623 --> 00:01:13.710
"The Office"-
- Note to self,

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.543
actors.
(all laughing)

00:01:14.543 --> 00:01:15.504
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:01:15.504 --> 00:01:17.005
- Thanks, Rainn-
- [Kelly] Note to self.

